  "scope": [
    "Filesystem backing was process-owned memory. WinFsp lifecycle calls were injected and real user-mode SDK callbacks were used.",
    "Both layouts retained their original volume and image selection through a failed mount followed by a fresh writable attachment. The independent CPU reader verified original and new bytes.",
    "The remount fixture also refused concurrent inspection, reopening after sealing and reopening after unconfirmed dispatcher stop.",
